{"title":"Career Roadmap · Management Trainee","role":"Management Trainee","summary":"A Management Trainee (MT) is an entry-level employee recruited into a structured development programme to learn different aspects of a business and prepare for a future supervisory or management position.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA General"},"about":[{"label":"Degree–Career Alignment","text":"Very Strong"},{"label":"Primary Domains","text":"Business Management, Operations, Sales, Marketing, Finance, HR, Business Analytics"},{"label":"Typical Entry Level","text":"Management Trainee / Graduate Trainee / Business Operations Trainee"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"What does a Management Trainee do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Management Trainee (MT) is an entry-level employee recruited into a structured development programme to learn different aspects of a business and prepare for a future supervisory or management position."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a specialised role such as accountant or software developer, an MT may rotate through multiple functions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"HR"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Business analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning business processes"},{"text":"Supporting departmental projects"},{"text":"Analysing operational data"},{"text":"Preparing management reports"},{"text":"Coordinating with teams"},{"text":"Monitoring KPIs"},{"text":"Supporting process improvement"},{"text":"Handling assigned business problems"},{"text":"Participating in cross-functional projects"},{"text":"Presenting findings to managers"},{"text":"Taking increasing ownership of business operations"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"\"Management Trainee\" is usually a programme/entry designation rather than a permanent job function. The trainee normally moves into a specialised role after completing the training period."}]},{"heading":"Career Development Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Skill development"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Communication + analytics + functional skills"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Choose business function"}],[{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Internship + leadership projects"}],[{"text":"First job"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Management Trainee"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Assistant Manager / Business Analyst / Executive"}],[{"text":"Mid-career"},{"text":"4–8 years"},{"text":"Manager"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"8–15+ years"},{"text":"Senior Manager / Business Head"}]]}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During BBA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a broad understanding of business."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Organisational Behaviour"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Introduction to Marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand how businesses work"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer","Product/Service","Marketing","Sales","Operations","Finance","Profit"]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Business KPIs"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Business & Analytical Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills that make you useful across departments."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PowerPoint"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Management presentations"},{"text":"Business proposals"},{"text":"KPI reports"},{"text":"Executive summaries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Business metrics"},{"text":"Basic forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a programmer, but basic data skills significantly improve employability."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Choose a Management Track","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A general BBA should not remain completely general throughout the degree."},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary career direction."},{"type":"h","text":"Option 1 — Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 2 — Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process management"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Lean"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations Executive"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Executive"},{"text":"Process Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 3 — Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Performance marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Growth Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 4 — Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Investment fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Operations Associate"},{"text":"FP&A Associate"},{"text":"Business Finance Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 5 — Human Resources"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"HR operations"},{"text":"Talent management"},{"text":"Compensation"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"HR analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR Executive"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition Associate"},{"text":"HR Analyst"},{"text":"People Operations Associate"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Leadership & Industry Readiness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the programme has a fourth year, use it to develop deeper specialisation and work experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Build capabilities in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Business analysis"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Decision-making"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn project-management tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Trello"},{"text":"Asana"},{"text":"Microsoft Project fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn business frameworks"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SWOT"},{"text":"PESTLE"},{"text":"Porter's Five Forces"},{"text":"Business Model Canvas"},{"text":"Customer journey mapping"},{"text":"Process mapping"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"5 Whys"},{"text":"Pareto analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Business Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional company's dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Regions"},{"text":"Products"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue growth"},{"text":"Profit margin"},{"text":"Sales performance"},{"text":"Customer growth"},{"text":"Regional performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Business Process Improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a process such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Online order","Payment","Warehouse","Shipping","Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bottlenecks"},{"text":"Delays"},{"text":"Errors"},{"text":"Cost drivers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then propose improvements."},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Process Map","Root Cause","Recommendation","Expected Impact"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Market Research Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a product or service."},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct a small structured survey and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer preferences"},{"text":"Price sensitivity"},{"text":"Purchase intent"},{"text":"Competitor perception"},{"text":"Customer demographics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel/Power BI for analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Business Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete business plan containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem"},{"text":"Target customer"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Market"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Revenue model"},{"text":"Cost structure"},{"text":"Marketing strategy"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Financial projections"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Management Consulting Case"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a fictional company experiencing declining sales."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Revenue ↓","Customer acquisition ↓","Conversion ↓","Retention ↓"]},{"type":"p","text":"Recommend actions based on data."},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates the structured problem-solving ability expected from management trainees."}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Expected Outcome"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"},{"text":"Understand organisations"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Analytics + communication"},{"text":"Become data-capable"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Functional specialisation"},{"text":"Build career direction"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Leadership + projects"},{"text":"Management readiness"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Internship + portfolio"},{"text":"Job-ready graduate"}]]}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Planning, organising, decision-making"}],[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Accounting + financial fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Customer + digital marketing basics"}],[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Process + productivity"}],[{"text":"HR"},{"text":"Recruitment + people management basics"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI + SQL"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Business writing + presentations"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Teamwork + ownership"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Agile + project planning"}],[{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"SWOT + competitive analysis"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"CRM + ERP + AI tools"}],[{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"Problem solving + stakeholder management"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are particularly important for a Management Trainee career."},{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from Year 2, with serious focus in Year 3."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Startups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Management Intern"},{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Operations Intern"},{"text":"Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Finance Intern"},{"text":"HR Intern"},{"text":"Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Business Development Intern"},{"text":"Project Management Intern"},{"text":"Consulting Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally, complete 2–3 internships/projects across different functions and then specialise."}]},{"heading":"First Jobs You Can Target","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct entry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Management Trainee"},{"text":"Graduate Management Trainee"},{"text":"Graduate Trainee"},{"text":"Business Management Trainee"},{"text":"Operations Management Trainee"},{"text":"Sales Management Trainee"},{"text":"Marketing Management Trainee"},{"text":"Finance Management Trainee"},{"text":"HR Management Trainee"},{"text":"Business Development Trainee"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other strong entry roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Business Development Executive"},{"text":"Sales Executive"},{"text":"Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Finance Executive"},{"text":"HR Executive"},{"text":"Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Operations Executive"},{"text":"Customer Success Executive"},{"text":"Supply Chain Executive"},{"text":"MIS/Reporting Analyst"}]}]},{"heading":"What Companies Usually Evaluate","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Management trainee recruitment often evaluates more than academic knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Aptitude"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quantitative ability"},{"text":"Logical reasoning"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Verbal ability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business understanding"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Customer understanding"},{"text":"Business strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioural"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Ownership"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Adaptability"},{"text":"Problem solving"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interviews"},{"type":"p","text":"Be prepared for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"Group discussions"},{"text":"Situational questions"},{"text":"Business problems"},{"text":"Presentation rounds"},{"text":"Behavioural interviews"}]}]},{"heading":"Build Leadership Evidence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Do not wait for a job title to demonstrate leadership."},{"type":"p","text":"During BBA:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead a college project"},{"text":"Organise an event"},{"text":"Manage a student team"},{"text":"Start a small business project"},{"text":"Participate in case competitions"},{"text":"Conduct market research"},{"text":"Manage a student club"},{"text":"Complete consulting-style projects"},{"text":"Coordinate an internship project"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Your resume should demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Action","Result"]},{"type":"p","text":"rather than merely:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Participated in a project.\""}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Business Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Business analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agile fundamentals"},{"text":"Scrum fundamentals"},{"text":"Project management fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Performance marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Corporate finance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Optional professional certifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the chosen career direction:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAPM/project management pathway"},{"text":"Professional Scrum certifications"},{"text":"Power BI certification"},{"text":"Financial modelling programmes"},{"text":"Digital marketing certifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should prioritise skills + internships + measurable projects over collecting many unrelated certificates."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"The most common postgraduate progression for a BBA graduate."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Human Resources"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"International Business"},{"text":"Supply Chain"},{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong MBA from a good institution can significantly expand management-track opportunities."},{"type":"h","text":"Other Master's Options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Economics"},{"text":"MSc Data Analytics"},{"text":"Master's in Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a student targeting management leadership, MBA + relevant work experience is generally more strategically valuable than pursuing a generic master's without a clear objective."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential programmes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master of Management"},{"text":"MSc Management"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Marketing"},{"text":"MSc International Business"},{"text":"MSc Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"MSc Entrepreneurship"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Check current programme eligibility, work experience requirements, tuition, visa rules and post-study work policies before applying."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Management trainees can branch into multiple career paths."},{"type":"h","text":"General Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA","Management Trainee","Assistant Manager","Manager","Senior Manager","Associate Director","Director","Business Unit Head","Business Head / General Manager","CXO"]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA","Management Trainee","Business Analyst","Senior Business Analyst","Analytics Manager","Senior Analytics Manager","Head of Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"flow","items":["Management Trainee","Operations Executive","Assistant Operations Manager","Operations Manager","Senior Operations Manager","Operations Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales/Marketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Management Trainee","Sales / Marketing Executive","Assistant Manager","Manager","Senior Manager","Business / Marketing Head"]}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Management Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Management roles are being transformed by AI, but the value of managers is not disappearing."},{"type":"p","text":"The role is shifting from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Managing information\""},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Making decisions using information.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Collect Reports","Review Data","Discuss Problems","Make Decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-enabled management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Data","Automated Analytics","AI Insights / Forecasts","Scenario Simulation","Managerial Judgement","Decision","Execution"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future management trainees should learn to use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI copilots"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Automated reporting"},{"text":"CRM analytics"},{"text":"Workflow automation"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Scenario modelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But they also need to understand AI limitations, data quality, privacy and responsible decision-making."}]},{"heading":"Future Career Opportunities: 2040–2046","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential future roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Business Manager"},{"text":"AI Transformation Manager"},{"text":"Digital Strategy Manager"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Manager"},{"text":"AI Product Manager"},{"text":"Automation Programme Manager"},{"text":"Data-Driven Operations Manager"},{"text":"Digital Business Head"},{"text":"AI Governance Manager"},{"text":"Technology Strategy Manager"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future managers will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business knowledge","data literacy","AI literacy","leadership","domain expertise."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["Management","Finance","Marketing","Operations","Strategy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","Power BI","Statistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI tools","CRM","ERP","Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"flow","items":["Communication","Negotiation","Team Management","Decision-making"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market Analysis","Competitive Analysis","Business Models","Financial Thinking"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agile","Project Planning","Process Improvement"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem Solving","Ownership","Presentation","Stakeholder Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong BBA graduate targeting Management Trainee roles should be able to take an ambiguous business problem and structure it:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Data","Root Cause","Options","Financial/Business Impact","Recommendation","Execution","KPI Measurement"]},{"type":"p","text":"They should also demonstrate leadership through internships, projects, case competitions or real business experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA General","Business fundamentals","Advanced Excel","Communication & presentations","SQL + Power BI","AI/business tools","Choose a functional specialisation","2–3 internships","Leadership/project experience","Management Trainee","Assistant Manager","Manager","Senior Manager","Business Unit/Functional Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the strongest long-term management trajectory, a particularly effective route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA","2–4 years of strong functional experience","MBA from a strong institution","Managerial/strategy role","Senior management"]}]}]}